#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:73
#: 211eb6239b074e78a25646822f226515 7100911eb8334452996d5d41a5ec8a4f
#: 71273662369149dbbebd7d312b75eb5d c7de313024bb4e55a6408d984210107d
#: c89fab5f85a647a7acbf77cc46912590 e883cf7945ab4ddcb92fe860557dcc19
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the R6 (UART6_RX) pin. It supports all RC "
"protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details for a "
"specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` is set to "
"\"23\", by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在 R6（UART6_RX）引脚上。支持除 PPM 外的所有 RC 协议。请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-systems` "
"了解特定 RC 系统详情。:ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 默认设置为 「23」 以启用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:75
#: 682acd08acf4400a81d5754864d66257 92a074fd515a4f3eaf521e1a1df29887
