#: f1d8a373d7f54e12b6ebdd62beec3a0b ff3e7414931f4714bc790aedbd55df42
msgid ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the R6 pin but SBUS requires that the "
":ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"3\"."
msgstr ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 R6 引脚，但 SBUS 要求将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` "
"设置为 「3」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7mini.rst:77
